 있다. 주변에는 로보카폴리 안전체험공원이 있다.","updated":"2024-09-23","facilities":[{"k":"주요시설","v":"일반야영장(20면)","items":["일반야영장(20면)"]},{"k":"기타 정보","v":"개인 트레일러 입장가능","items":["개인 트레일러 입장가능"]},{"k":"기타 부대시설","v":"드럼체험장","items":["드럼체험장"]},{"k":"사이트 간격","v":"3M"},{"k":"바닥형태 (단위:면)","v":"파쇄석 (20)","items":["파쇄석 (20)"]},{"k":"캠핑장비대여","v":"캠핑장 문의","items":["캠핑장 문의"]},{"k":"반려동물 출입","v":"불가능"},{"k":"화로대","v":"개별"},{"k":"안전시설현황","v":"소화기 (20)","items":["소화기 (20)"]}],"photos":["https://www.gocamping.or.kr/upload/camp/100036/8837S0KYPV3fJlHCjvyv3tOy.jpg","https://www.gocamping.or.kr/upload/camp/100036/8722zNfW4UqvmE9ZvHZ0S2fZ.jpg","https://www.gocamping.or.kr/upload/camp/100036/9849yUG4YkVoJ8H2sPOR94pO.jpg","https://www.gocamping.or.kr/upload/camp/100036/23863YbBoZp7JspnPzTeoFIq.jpg","https://www.gocamping.or.kr/upload/camp/100036/1638hXhTETowvbcagzFIDoNI.jpg","https://www.gocamping.or.kr/upload/camp/100036/00462z0fyiivuu7o9jqNOC21.jpg","https://www.gocamping.or.kr/upload/camp/100036/735969hJJv3nOAyER4rK6miT.jpg","https://www.gocamping.or.kr/upload/camp/100036/98035LnquAaJxJKOgKr89AEk.jpg","https://www.gocamping.or.kr/upload/camp/100036/9734qOYLRSvz0Q3VXwdXpkVR.jpg","https://www.gocamping.or.kr/upload/camp/100036/3064Ht3MxprOexAUDSUtmn8i.jpg","https://www.gocamping.or.kr/upload/camp/100036/1687NuLbABpMeiUslMOQ77g1.jpg","https://www.gocamping.or.kr/upload/camp/100036/480224mvJMxjarfwLncxo7xh.jpg","https://www.gocamping.or.kr/upload/camp/100036/8158UCRXXnepJLa7qL5C6LiP.jpg","https://www.gocamping.or.kr/upload/camp/100036/2067qJkEQOF4EzrBgofcaGgT.jpg","https://www.gocamping.or.kr/upload/camp/100036/0940vJ2mBZnYLPBHdQiaKPD8.jpg"],"layout":["https://www.gocamping.or.kr/upload/camp/100036/5195bedMEatWCVHuHZffJvZA.jpg"],"checked_at":"2026-10-20T04:28:39.780Z"}}